  'page 117 # text only # Currier\'s language B # has \'key-like\' sequence # has non-Voynich writing # Brumbaugh Yale Lib Gaz p352 # Roe, 3 Sept 93 # Normal text in paragraphs with, to the left, single characters # (not exactly one per line) and left of that occasional single words. # The text layout of Mike Roe is not used here. # Text near the \'dead body\' is Lx label, and all other characters # and words L0 labels (1-15 for the words, 16-40 for the characters) # # R In the bottom left hand corner, there is a picture of a woman lying down # R (dead?). To the left of the woman are two circles and a cylinder. Above # R her are four words in Voynich text. To the far left are four words in # R a different hand and a different alphabet. # R # R In the bottom right hand corner there is a symbol that looks like a number 2 # R on its side. #': 'page 117 # text only # Currier\'s language B # has \'key-like\' sequence # has non-Voynich writing # Brumbaugh Yale Lib Gaz p352 # Roe, 3 Sept 93 # Normal text in paragraphs with, to the left, single characters # (not exactly one per line) and left of that occasional single words. # The text layout of Mike Roe is not used here. # Text near the \'dead body\' is Lx label, and all other characters # and words L0 labels (1-15 for the words, 16-40 for the characters) # # R In the bottom left hand corner, there is a picture of a woman lying down # R (dead?). To the left of the woman are two circles and a cylinder. Above # R her are four words in Voynich text. To the far left are four words in # R a different hand and a different alphabet. # R # R In the bottom right hand corner there is a symbol that looks like a number 2 # R on its side. #',
